<title>USA: American Eagle May same-store sales up.</title>
<headline>American Eagle May same-store sales up.</headline>
<dateline>WARRENDALE, Pa. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Eagle Outfitters Inc Thursday reported sales for the four and 17 week periods ended May 31.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$23.8	$19.5     +22.1	+10.5</p>
<p>Year-to-date     $84.7	$73.9     +14.7	 +5.2</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
